# "vocal bass" and "doo bass" (bass track, mono): low notes down to C1, a velocity range for the breathy onset,
# a pitch bend, and the vowel jumping between notes.
tempo 110
steps 16
tail 1.5
track bass
preset 80 24 0 80 200 30 0 0 128 0 128 205 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 C2 2 127
note 2 C2 1 60
note 3 G1 1 90
note 4 Bb1 2 127
param p1 230 6
note 6 F1 2 110
note 8 C1 2 127
bend 8 -200
param p1 50 10
param decay 45 10
param sustain 0 10
bend 10 0
note 10 Eb2 1 127
note 11 Eb2 1 30
note 12 G1 2 120
note 14 C2 2 127
expect sound 0 16
expect idle 30
expect peak_below -4
